Wrote coder-3.json with one row for `education-library-books` (Stacey Donato). HB 1447 (2023) is an omnibus education bill — the library-removal chapter (Ch. 5.5) lets both parents and community members request removal, reviewed by the governing body, which doesn't cleanly match any single rung, and the vote/sponsorship are multi-subject without a tying statement — so I coded V6 BLANK `direction-only` rather than force a chair.
